      "text": "Critical edition introduction — Odran Hymnal (fictional).\nIn this document \"OH-MS\" means Odran Hymnal. Odran Hymnal reports lacunae share of 20.8% for FY2025 on a reported basis. Odran Hymnal reports radiocarbon median date (CE) of 919 year. Odran Hymnal: number of scribal hands for FY2024 — not provided. Odran Hymnal reports quire count of 38 for FY2025."
    },
