      "text": "Catalogue entry — Odran Hymnal (fictional).\nOdran Hymnal reports lacunae share of 25.1% for FY2025 on a adjusted (management definition) basis. Odran Hymnal reports radiocarbon median date (CE) of 1130 year for FY2024. Odran Hymnal reports folio count of 272 for FY2024. Odran Hymnal reports witness count of 29.058 for FY2025."
    },
